/ios
/android

# Google Play service account key for `eas submit`. A credential that can
# publish releases to the Play Store — it must never enter git. The generic
# *.json patterns above deliberately don't exist because app.json, eas.json
# and tsconfig.json all need tracking, so name the shape of these keys.
*-service-account*.json
# Google Play service-account keys, whatever cloud project issued them.
nexora-*-*.json
jasora-*-*.json
google-play-*.json

# Written by `eas credentials` when downloading credentials locally: holds the
# keystore passwords and key alias in plaintext.
credentials.json
